# Portfolio code

- Import only from `src/portfolio/`. Do not import `src/blog/`.
- Do not use blog CUBE classes, Typekit, or `src/blog/css`.
- PostCSS must not run blog Tailwind on files under `src/portfolio/` (see `postcss.config.cjs`).
- New funnel routes belong in `src/pages` as thin files that only import the portfolio layout.
